    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "A local initiative",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "この 町 では、若者 が 町 を 離れつつあり、商店街 の 店 も 少しずつ 減っている。",
       "alumno": "In this town, young people are leaving and the shops in the shopping street are also decreasing little by little.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "市 は 地元 の 企業 と 協力して、夜間 の 職業講座 を 始めた。",
       "alumno": "The city hall worked together with local companies to start evening professional courses.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "参加者 は 仕事 の かたわら、週 に 二回、地域 の 教室 で 技術 を 学ぶ。",
       "alumno": "Participants learn skills in a local classroom twice a week, alongside their jobs.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "責任者 は「この 講座 だけ で 町 の 問題 が すべて 解決する とは 言う まい。仕事 を しながら 学べる 場所 は 必要 だ」と 説明した。",
       "alumno": "The person in charge explained: \"I am not going to claim that this course alone will solve all of the town's problems. Places where people can learn while working are needed.\"",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "一年後、参加者 の 一部 は 地元 の 会社 で 働き始めた。",
       "alumno": "A year later, some of the participants began to work at local companies.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
